<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Karen's Universe — Inicio</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --pink-pastel: #F8DDEB;
            --pink-soft: #F4C7D7;
            --pink-muted: #E8B4C8;
            --lavender: #E6D5F0;
            --mint: #D5F0E8;
            --peach: #F5E0D0;
            --yellow-pastel: #FFF9D9;
            --cream: #FFF8EE;
            --beige: #E8D8C3;
            --brown-soft: #C89F9C;
            --burgundy: #8F4F5F;
            --blue-pastel: #AFC6D8;

            --shadow-soft: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            --shadow-med: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF9F5 0%, #F5F0FF 50%, #F0F8F8 100%);
            color: #4a3d3d;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* NAVEGACIÓN */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: rgba(255, 248, 238, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 1.2rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            z-index: 999;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        nav a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink-soft), var(--peach));
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background: rgba(248, 221, 235, 0.3);
        }

        nav a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero {
            margin-top: 80px;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 2rem;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-content {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 700px;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--brown-soft);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .hero-tagline {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #6b5555;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .hero-decor {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            opacity: 0.4;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .decor-1 { top: 10%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .decor-2 { top: 15%; right: 8%; animation-delay: 1s; }
        .decor-3 { bottom: 20%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .decor-4 { bottom: 15%; right: 10%; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
        .decor-5 { top: 30%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        .decor-6 { bottom: 25%; left: 20%; animation-delay: 1.2s; }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-15px); }
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-soft), var(--peach));
            color: var(--burgundy);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy), var(--brown-soft));
            color: var(--cream);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-med);
        }

        .scroll-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
            40% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-10px); }
            60% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-5px); }
        }

        .highlights {
            padding: 60px 2rem 80px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 60px;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink-soft), var(--peach), var(--lavender));
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .highlight-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .highlight-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .highlight-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-med);
        }

        .highlight-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .highlight-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .highlight-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #6b5555;
        }

        footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-soft), var(--lavender));
            color: var(--burgundy);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        footer p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        footer .footer-decor {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav {
                gap: 1rem;
                padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            }

            nav a {
                font-size: 0.85rem;
                padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <a href="/">Inicio</a>
        <a href="/about/">Sobre mí</a>
        <a href="/Blog/">Blog</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
        <div class="hero-decor decor-1">✨</div>
        <div class="hero-decor decor-2">☕</div>
        <div class="hero-decor decor-3">📚</div>
        <div class="hero-decor decor-4">🎵</div>
        <div class="hero-decor decor-5">♟️</div>
        <div class="hero-decor decor-6">🌸</div>

        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Karen</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">pequeño universo personal</p>
            <p class="hero-tagline">
                En algún rincón entre las tazas de café, las páginas de libros con historias que me atrapan, la música que me entiende, y tres gatos que son mi razón de sonreír. Así es mi mundo.
            </p>
            <a href="/about/" class="cta-button">Conoce mi mundo</a>
        </div>

        <div class="scroll-indicator">↓</div>
    </section>

    <!-- PREVIEW DE SECCIONES -->
    <section class="highlights">
        <h2 class="section-title">Explora mi sitio</h2>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
            <a href="/about/" class="highlight-card">
                <div class="highlight-icon">🌸</div>
                <h3>Sobre mí</h3>
                <p>Café, ajedrez, gatos y las historias que amo.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/" class="highlight-card">
                <div class="highlight-icon">📝</div>
                <h3>Blog</h3>
                <p>Aquí voy dejando lo que aprendo por el camino.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <p>En algún lugar entre el café y los libros, el ajedrez y la música,</p>
        <p>existe un pequeño universo que es completamente, perfectamente mío.</p>
        <div class="footer-decor">
            ☕ 📚 🎵 ♟️
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>